From 12e3841898896a041d4692a9ba55aa62d5a357eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:04:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: backport ath10k shikra wlanmdsp stability fix

linux-firmware 20261019 ships WLAN.HL.3.3.7.c5-00093.2 for the
WCN3990 shikra/wlanmdsp.mbn firmware, which has known stability
issues; the fix was merged into linux-firmware.git after the
20261019 release tag was cut.

Backport the upstream commit updating the firmware to
WLAN.HL.3.3.7.c5-00226 ahead of the next linux-firmware release.
The firmware patch replaces a binary file, so switch PATCHTOOL to
git for this recipe.

Link: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/commit/?id=72f3b81c89fbc52677b9dbbfa92cde0ae00a36e2

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Viswanath Kraleti <viswanath.kraleti@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [meta-qcom specific]
---
 ...w1.0-update-shikra-wlanmdsp.mbn-to-W.patch | 26846 ++++++++++++++++
 .../linux-firmware/linux-firmware_20261019.bb |     5 +-
 2 files changed, 26850 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 meta/recipes-kernel/linux-firmware/linux-firmware/0001-ath10k-WCN3990-hw1.0-update-shikra-wlanmdsp.mbn-to-W.patch

